{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "d6c1b5873f650e84a02bf1ea9e190d95076e4b08680fa6a333181b9c36b50c2f", "ja": "お得に元気にショッピング♪", "zh": "超值又有精神地购物♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9ee7fb548532571141a7a8910f19b2fe0f51a8969e7a096c3141e5fc6b1878e5", "ja": "出店用の買い出しに来たやよい、杏奈、\n可奈、莉緒。お得なスーパーに案内する\nやよいや、実家からタダでレモンを送って\nもらおうと提案する莉緒など、4人はそれ\nぞれの方法で、記念公演の準備に貢献する。", "zh": "来为摊位采购的弥生、杏奈、可奈和莉绪。弥生带大家去划算的超市，莉绪则提议让家里免费寄些柠檬过来，4人用各自的方式为纪念公演的准备工作贡献了力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "24fdc8496fcce0e0416590d80cad60cddfc722030bfd953f02721a7db2963a98", "ja": "（出店の食材の買い出しのため、やよいオススメの\n安くてお得なスーパーにやって来た）", "zh": "（为了采购摊位所需的食材，我们来到了やよい推荐的便宜又实惠的超市。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "2465b235e88e1b0e3777c21d1ff4e956041a9610255be577823c7bf9cdcfcc3f", "ja": "今日は、バナナの特売日なんですよ！　あと、かき氷の\nシロップも、ここのスーパーが一番安いんです！", "zh": "今天是香蕉特价日哦！还有刨冰糖浆，这家超市也是最便宜的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3bee6dab2c101ee7d57fefe89a441279374b4e7cbd987d8f5da52754c9ec18fa", "ja": "やよいがいてくれると、助かるよ。\n予算にも限りがあるからな。", "zh": "有弥生在，真是帮大忙了。\n毕竟预算也是有限的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "1d7b6ac0851681215d21be8f8e05769f96face33871f004d337cf19c3ce1929d", "ja": "じゃあ私、バナナ取ってきま～す！　杏奈ちゃんは\nシロップお願いね……って、杏奈ちゃん、どうしたの？", "zh": "那我去拿香蕉～！杏奈，糖浆就拜托你了……咦，杏奈，你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "01ec63dbdf02c79907fd6e8c7397c00dbdc29f8cdf3c6f5fad812f4b74034c54", "ja": "ん……ごめん……。杏奈……なんだか、\n疲れちゃった……。充電切れ……かも……。", "zh": "嗯……对不起……。杏奈……总觉得、\n好累……。可能是……没电了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "f5f643438029f0b759270068a2abb57359599440a72da687f1b2782f9515cc13", "ja": "えっ、ど、どうしよう！　えっと……フレ～フレ～♪\n杏奈ちゃ～ん♪　充電満タ～ン♪　元気満タ～ン♪", "zh": "诶，怎、怎么办！那个……加油～加油～♪\n杏奈酱～♪　电量满格～♪　精神满格～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "b1fe671448cc1b4efe3c2551a4447efceca4cc089964ac82f911bf872f047d2c", "ja": "可奈……。ありがと……。ちょっと、元気出た……。\n杏奈、シロップ……取ってくる、ね……。", "zh": "可奈……。谢谢你……。我稍微、打起精神来了……。\n杏奈去……拿糖浆过来、哦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "58ac38f84af980808bfd44c37e908f3e9b33904a386294cdec93351636edd490", "ja": "あ、シロップにレモン味を追加するのはどうかしら？\n私の実家にお願いしたら、タダでもらえるはずよ。", "zh": "啊，要不要给糖浆加上柠檬味？  \n拜托我家里准备的话，应该能免费拿到哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "d3e2e8c68aa7c854bbeb7f0ee9f5e86c420e61c6adc7d05aeedaf07c2ab55139", "ja": "そっか！　莉緒さんの実家って、レモン農家さん\nでしたよね！　うっうー！　タダなんてお得ですー！", "zh": "原来如此！莉绪姐的老家是种柠檬的农户，对吧！  \n嗯嗯——！免费的话，太划算啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1009_p", "source_sha256": "721416e7662b85d5a26346c6d90b8f36df23a39980f0348f8268370653677ed1", "ja": "莉緒、提案ありがとう。\nそれじゃあ、お言葉に甘えてもいいか？", "zh": "莉绪，谢谢你的提议。那我就恭敬不如从命了，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "d155bd37a83256effb3e7419fd8af3a6cfe12a63a8fd98a605658cba572f37c3", "ja": "もちろんよ！　……あ、{$P$}くん。\nさては私のこと、惚れ直しちゃった？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "当然没问题啦！……啊，{$P$}。\n莫非你又重新迷上我了？呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0388_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0388_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "18e3e38fa0d066093a4ad969956c59244a533f49904f29a519563d6dd6f0af7b", "ja": "（莉緒は相変わらずだな……。まあ、おかげで\nかき氷のメニューも増やせそうだし、よかったな）", "zh": "（莉绪还是老样子啊……不过，多亏了她，刨冰菜单似乎也能增加了，这样也好）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
